ed hogi, isliye pehle free methods par focus karna behtar hai.\n\n**Kyun Reels ya Bade Paid Ads abhi nahi:**\n*   **Reels:** Reels banane mein time aur effort lagta hai, aur tumhare paas abhi limited photos hain. Achhe reels ke liye thodi planning aur editing skills chahiye hoti hain.\n*   **Bade Paid Ads:** ₹500 ka budget bade paid ad campaigns ke liye kaafi nahi hai. Ismein tumhein sahi audience tak pahunchne mein mushkil hogi.\n\n**Honest Limitation:**\nSales double hone ki guarantee nahi hai, lekin yeh plan tumhari shop ki visibility badhane mein help karega aur college students tak tumhara message pahunchayega. **Lesson 08: Kahan Aur Kab Post Karein** mein bhi bataya gaya hai ki posting time sirf andaaza hai, data nahi, aur 2-3 hafte baad dekho kya chala aur badlo.",
